28
00:03:07.395 --> 00:03:08.771 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>难道他…</c.simplifiedchinese>

29
00:03:08.855 --> 00:03:11.316 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
