30
00:03:22.702 --> 00:03:23.995 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

31
00:03:24.078 --> 00:03:26.372 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>用小太刀建立严密的防守</c.simplifiedchinese>

32
00:03:26.456 --> 00:03:30.043 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
