44
00:04:12.377 --> 00:04:15.213 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>德川幕府最后一位将军德川庆喜</c.simplifiedchinese>

45
00:04:15.296 --> 00:04:17.757 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>得知他的军队占劣势</c.simplifiedchinese>

46
00:04:17.840 --> 00:04:21.803 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
