47
00:04:21.886 --> 00:04:24.305 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>乘军舰逃到江户</c.simplifiedchinese>

48
00:04:24.389 --> 00:04:27.016 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>上万的将士们在战场上血染黄沙</c.simplifiedchinese>

49
00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:30.019 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>却被他抛弃了</c.simplifiedchinese>

50
00:04:30.937 --> 00:04:32.814 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>逃到江户后</c.simplifiedchinese>

51
00:04:32.897 --> 00:04:35.858 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他自己避入上野的宽永寺
