53
00:04:41.155 --> 00:04:44.534 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>最终江户城无血开城</c.simplifiedchinese>

54
00:04:45.243 --> 00:04:50.123 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>御庭番众还没投身战斗
幕末时代就结束了</c.simplifiedchinese>

55
00:04:51.833 --> 00:04:54.252 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>德川那个懦夫怎样我不在乎</c.simplifiedchinese>

56
00:04:55.169 --> 00:04:58.506 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但我们对没能参与战斗深感遗憾</c.simplifiedchinese>

57
