59
00:05:05.138 --> 00:05:08.141 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>最终的胜利将会属于我们幕府</c.simplifiedchinese>

60
00:05:12.770 --> 00:05:14.689 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们会在江户城放一场大火</c.simplifiedchinese>

61
00:05:14.772 --> 00:05:18.484 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>趁混乱之际 御庭番众出手</c.simplifiedchinese>

62
00:05:18.568 --> 00:05:20.903 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>杀死负责重要位置的维新志士</c.simplifiedchinese>

63
00:05:21.571 --> 00:05:24.240 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样一来 剩下的乌合之众</c.simplifiedchinese>

64
00:05:24.324 --> 00:05:28.036 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
