65
00:05:28.745 --> 00:05:29.954 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样就结束了</c.simplifiedchinese>

66
00:05:31.497 --> 00:05:34.042 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那种事怎么可能做得到！</c.simplifiedchinese>

67
00:05:34.125 --> 00:05:35.626 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>做得到</c.simplifiedchinese>

68
00:05:35.710 --> 00:05:38.046 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不信的话 我把计划再现给你看</c.simplifiedchinese>

69
00:05:38.838 --> 00:05:40.006 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在这东京</c.simplifiedchinese>

70
