72
00:05:47.013 --> 00:05:50.433 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>重要的是我要证明</c.simplifiedchinese>

73
00:05:51.184 --> 00:05:54.520 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
