74
00:05:54.604 --> 00:05:57.482 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>应该属于御庭番众</c.simplifiedchinese>

75
00:06:00.693 --> 00:06:01.569 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
