76
00:06:02.487 --> 00:06:06.449 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不论是维新志士还是幕府武士</c.simplifiedchinese>

77
00:06:06.532 --> 00:06:08.409 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>许多人在战场上献出了生命</c.simplifiedchinese>

78
00:06:09.077 --> 00:06:10.745 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然互为敌人</c.simplifiedchinese>

79
00:06:10.828 --> 00:06:15.541 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>却没有对错之分</c.simplifiedchinese>

80
00:06:15.625 --> 00:06:17.543 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只是为了国家的未来</c.simplifiedchinese>

