82
00:06:23.174 --> 00:06:25.051 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但你不是！</c.simplifiedchinese>

83
00:06:25.134 --> 00:06:27.970 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
