84
00:06:28.054 --> 00:06:31.641 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>沾满鲜血的只有一颗冰冷的好斗之心</c.simplifiedchinese>

85
00:06:32.391 --> 00:06:34.727 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不论作为维新志士还是浪客</c.simplifiedchinese>

86
