89
00:06:44.112 --> 00:06:44.987 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>来吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

90
00:06:52.078 --> 00:06:54.872 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不论是飞天御剑流的龙槌闪</c.simplifiedchinese>

91
00:06:54.956 --> 00:06:57.166 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>还是空中拔刀术</c.simplifiedchinese>

92
00:06:57.250 --> 00:06:58.960 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不错的攻击</c.simplifiedchinese>

93
00:06:59.043 --> 00:07:02.588 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但我的小太刀可没那么容易折断</c.simplifiedchinese>

94
00:07:04.006 --> 00:07:04.882 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>可恶！</c.simplifiedchinese>

95
00:07:05.883 --> 00:07:07.301 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>苍紫那混蛋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

96
00:07:07.385 --> 00:07:10.596 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>被我雇来还敢忤逆我</c.simplifiedchinese>

97
00:07:11.389 --> 00:07:15.059 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>惠和苍紫 两个都是混蛋</c.simplifiedchinese>

98
00:07:15.143 --> 00:07:17.645 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过我明白了</c.simplifiedchinese>

99
00:07:17.728 --> 00:07:22.191 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>和拔刀斋一样 那家伙对钱没兴趣</c.simplifiedchinese>

100
00:07:22.275 --> 00:07:26.070 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么时候与我为敌也不奇怪
实在太危险了</c.simplifiedchinese>

101
00:07:26.154 --> 00:07:30.408 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>拔刀斋和苍紫
有没有同时除掉他们俩的办法？</c.simplifiedchinese>

102
00:07:30.491 --> 00:07:31.701 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>想一想 观柳</c.simplifiedchinese>

103
00:07:31.784 --> 00:07:34.078 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>动动脑子 想想办法</c.simplifiedchinese>

104
00:07:34.162 --> 00:07:36.539 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>仔细想…</c.simplifiedchinese>

105
00:07:37.123 --> 00:07:39.000 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
