<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心竟然一次都没打到他…</c.simplifiedchinese>

111
00:08:01.272 --> 00:08:02.148 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且</c.simplifiedchinese>

112
00:08:02.231 --> 00:08:06.444 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
