113
00:08:06.527 --> 00:08:08.446 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是寒冰一般的好胜心</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:08:09.113 --> 00:08:12.158 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>该死 我的腿动不了了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:08:12.241 --> 00:08:13.534 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
