116
00:08:13.618 --> 00:08:15.286 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没事</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:08:15.870 --> 00:08:19.248 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果这样就被打倒了
