118
00:08:19.332 --> 00:08:21.375 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>也没脸回去见薰小姐</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:08:21.459 --> 00:08:24.295 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>想想阿左会怎么说我…</c.simplifiedchinese>

