<c.simplifiedchinese>不过以你的个性不会这么做</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:08:36.933 --> 00:08:38.184 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>让我领教一下吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:08:38.851 --> 00:08:40.228 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的破解之法</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:08:42.104 --> 00:08:43.189 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>太慢了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
