<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？握着刀刃的根部…</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:08:49.695 --> 00:08:50.571 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>苍紫</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:08:51.197 --> 00:08:52.949 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你强大的秘密在于</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:08:53.032 --> 00:08:56.410 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>完美地控制对手的间合</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:08:56.494 --> 00:08:57.870 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>间合…</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:08:58.746 --> 00:09:00.289 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>听好了 弥彦</c.simplifiedchinese>

