147
00:10:05.354 --> 00:10:08.274 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是…剑舞？</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:10:08.899 --> 00:10:10.484 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>跟仪式性的剑舞不同</c.simplifiedchinese>

