150
00:10:16.032 --> 00:10:20.244 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你太拘泥于动静分明的剑术套路</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:10:20.328 --> 00:10:23.831 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>无法捕捉到这种缓急自在的流水动作</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
