153
00:10:29.086 --> 00:10:31.964 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就是四乃森苍紫真正的本领</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:10:32.882 --> 00:10:33.799 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>去死吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:10:38.638 --> 00:10:39.513 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
