156
00:10:42.600 --> 00:10:44.143 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>回天剑舞</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:10:44.894 --> 00:10:48.564 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>能解决所有潜入江户城盗贼的招式</c.simplifiedchinese>

