00:10:49.190 --> 00:10:50.024 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑…</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:10:52.068 --> 00:10:52.943 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:10:53.819 --> 00:10:55.154 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>结束了 小子</c.simplifiedchinese>

