<c.simplifiedchinese>在下也不能在这种地方死掉</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:11:29.230 --> 00:11:30.272 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:11:31.232 --> 00:11:32.733 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你难道是不死之身吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

