175
00:11:44.703 --> 00:11:47.206 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>迅速举起剑鞘削弱一半攻击威力</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:11:48.374 --> 00:11:49.959 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>了不起的男人</c.simplifiedchinese>

