00:13:46.575 --> 00:13:49.245 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不 只是昏过去了</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:13:49.328 --> 00:13:52.331 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
