<c.simplifiedchinese>不是刽子手了</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:14:43.632 --> 00:14:46.302 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过即使没有了结你</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:14:46.385 --> 00:14:50.764 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>以你的智慧也明白究竟谁胜谁负</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:14:52.766 --> 00:14:54.977 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>苍紫 回答我一件事</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:14:55.603 --> 00:14:57.521 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然在暗中进行任务</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:14:57.605 --> 00:15:00.941 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但你担任御庭番众的首领这样的要职</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:15:01.734 --> 00:15:02.818 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在维新这个时期</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:15:02.902 --> 00:15:05.821 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>总有一、两个机会聘请你做士官吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:15:06.488 --> 00:15:09.992 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果想施展能力</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:15:10.075 --> 00:15:12.494 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一定还有其他地方可以施展</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:15:14.079 --> 00:15:16.624 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>的确有不少人想聘请我做士官</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:15:17.416 --> 00:15:18.751 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>上至加入陆军情报部</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:15:18.834 --> 00:15:22.296 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>下至政府要员的保镖
各种职位应有尽有</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:15:23.297 --> 00:15:25.841 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但这些职位只提供给我一个人</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:15:27.343 --> 00:15:31.388 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>火男和恶见这种只精通某种技能的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:15:31.472 --> 00:15:34.433 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>式尉这种倒戈过的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:15:34.516 --> 00:15:37.478 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果你看过般若的脸你就会明白</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:15:38.187 --> 00:15:43.150 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>其他的御庭番众成员
没有得到任何做士官的机会</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:15:44.610 --> 00:15:49.865 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>首领抛弃下属去政府担任职位
我怎么做得到？</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:15:50.908 --> 00:15:55.287 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不愿意做出像德川庆喜那样的背叛</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:15:56.121 --> 00:15:57.081 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>德川庆喜…</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:15:57.164 --> 00:15:58.457 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我知道</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:15:59.625 --> 00:16:02.878 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他所实行的绝对恭顺</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:16:02.962 --> 00:16:06.048 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是为了避免战争持续削弱国力
高度的政治判断</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:16:06.131 --> 00:16:09.760 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但我依然做不到</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:16:13.764 --> 00:16:15.891 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我带领着御庭番众</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:16:15.975 --> 00:16:18.894 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>被丢到明治的新首都东京后
已经过了十年</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:16:19.770 --> 00:16:22.815 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我目送着他们一个个开启新的生活</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:16:22.898 --> 00:16:24.692 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>最后剩下的部下只有四个</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:16:26.318 --> 00:16:31.657 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们是除了战斗外一无所长的可怜人</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:16:32.825 --> 00:16:38.247 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>因此我想至少让他们得到最强的称号</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:40.666 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>为御庭番众增添荣誉</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:16:43.127 --> 00:16:44.795 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>了结我吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:16:44.878 --> 00:16:49.049 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>否则今后我会一直追杀你</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:16:52.928 --> 00:16:56.432 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真丢人啊 四乃森苍紫</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:16:56.515 --> 00:16:57.933 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>哈喽</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:16:58.017 --> 00:17:01.145 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们的对话太长了
我实在忍不住打断</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:17:01.228 --> 00:17:02.438 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>观柳…</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:17:03.022 --> 00:17:05.149 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>正好不用费力气找你了</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:17:05.232 --> 00:17:07.860 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你真是自信啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:17:07.943 --> 00:17:12.906 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过看到这个
你还能保持这份自信吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:17:13.907 --> 00:17:15.617 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-这是…
-难道是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:17:16.785 --> 00:17:18.120 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>加特林机枪！</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:17:18.203 --> 00:17:19.580 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:17:19.663 --> 00:17:21.331 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>1861年美国医生加特林发明的</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:17:21.415 --> 00:17:25.335 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在美国南北战争中</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:17:25.419 --> 00:17:28.297 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>让北军大获全胜的最强武器</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:17:28.380 --> 00:17:30.966 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>日本的越后长冈藩购入了它</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:17:31.050 --> 00:17:32.885 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在戊辰战争第三战役北越战争中</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:17:32.968 --> 00:17:36.930 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>它成为了政府军的最大威胁</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:17:37.014 --> 00:17:41.268 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>拥有改变历史的破坏力
和能创造新时代的高性能</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:17:41.351 --> 00:17:43.604 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好好尝尝它的滋味吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:17:43.687 --> 00:17:46.607 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>加特林射击！</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:17:49.860 --> 00:17:50.903 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那是什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:17:52.654 --> 00:17:53.864 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿剑…</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:17:54.782 --> 00:17:58.077 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>吵死了 什么声音？</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:17:58.160 --> 00:18:01.163 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>听起来楼上发生了什么异变</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:18:01.246 --> 00:18:02.414 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>般若</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:18:02.498 --> 00:18:04.124 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>放松点</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:08.462 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>式尉和我已经输掉了战斗</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:18:08.545 --> 00:18:13.133 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没兴趣趁着对手熟睡时偷袭
成为卑鄙的赢家</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:18:13.717 --> 00:18:17.137 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我更担心的是苍紫大人</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:18:17.221 --> 00:18:20.015 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我和式尉要上楼 你呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:18:20.099 --> 00:18:23.811 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你人还挺好</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:18:23.894 --> 00:18:25.938 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我只听见有人在讽刺我</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:18:27.439 --> 00:18:28.607 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:18:28.690 --> 00:18:30.692 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>醒醒 式尉</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:18:34.113 --> 00:18:36.115 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么啊？是般若</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:18:36.198 --> 00:18:39.326 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>睁开眼就看见你这张脸
真是提神醒脑啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:18:39.409 --> 00:18:41.787 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是的 全都这样</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:18:43.122 --> 00:18:44.414 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂 小矮个</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:18:44.498 --> 00:18:45.749 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>干什么 肥猪？</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:18:46.333 --> 00:18:48.293 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>刚才的动静你听到了吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:18:48.377 --> 00:18:52.756 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这肥猪也听到了 那我没有听错</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:18:53.590 --> 00:18:56.593 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>看来现在不是睡觉的时候</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:18:59.263 --> 00:19:01.473 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么样？厉害吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:19:02.266 --> 00:19:06.520 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一分钟可以发射二百发子弹哟！</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:19:06.603 --> 00:19:11.024 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>混蛋 他故意射偏 就为了遛我们</c.simplifiedchinese>

297
00:19:11.108 --> 00:19:13.527 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>加特…</c.simplifiedchinese>

298
00:19:13.610 --> 00:19:16.238 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>停下来就要被我打中了哦</c.simplifiedchinese>

299
00:19:16.321 --> 00:19:18.615 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>观柳 你怎么会有这种武器？</c.simplifiedchinese>

300
00:19:18.699 --> 00:19:21.285 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>竟敢不叫我观柳大人！</c.simplifiedchinese>

301
00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:24.997 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>苍紫</c.simplifiedchinese>

302
00:19:25.080 --> 00:19:26.206 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好了</c.simplifiedchinese>

303
00:19:26.290 --> 00:19:28.375 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>差不多了</c.simplifiedchinese>

304
00:19:28.458 --> 00:19:31.295 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>抽根烟休息一下 我来回答你的疑问</c.simplifiedchinese>

305
00:19:33.422 --> 00:19:38.802 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我的最终目的
是成为世界上最富有的商人</c.simplifiedchinese>

306
00:19:38.886 --> 00:19:41.180 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>“死亡商人”</c.simplifiedchinese>

307
00:19:41.763 --> 00:19:44.057 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>也就是武器商人</c.simplifiedchinese>

308
00:19:45.642 --> 00:19:48.145 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>通过贩卖新型鸦片</c.simplifiedchinese>

309
00:19:48.228 --> 00:19:52.399 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>为加特林机枪筹集资金</c.simplifiedchinese>

310
00:19:52.482 --> 00:19:56.028 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就是大商人武田观柳大人
与生俱来的使命</c.simplifiedchinese>

311
00:19:56.111 --> 00:19:58.697 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这家伙竟然…</c.simplifiedchinese>

312
00:19:58.780 --> 00:20:04.244 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>为了赚钱不惜践踏别人的生命</c.simplifiedchinese>

313
00:20:05.954 --> 00:20:08.123 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

314
00:20:08.207 --> 00:20:11.126 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你为了得到那超凡的力量</c.simplifiedchinese>

315
00:20:11.210 --> 00:20:14.213 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>付出了多少年月和代价</c.simplifiedchinese>

316
00:20:14.296 --> 00:20:17.758 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>肯定不容易 对吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

317
00:20:18.342 --> 00:20:19.551 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过</c.simplifiedchinese>

318
00:20:19.635 --> 00:20:23.180 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>有了钱想获得力量就易如反掌！</c.simplifiedchinese>

319
00:20:23.263 --> 00:20:26.183 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只要一瞬间 不用付出任何代价！</c.simplifiedchinese>

320
00:20:26.266 --> 00:20:29.645 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>金钱才是真正实力的证明！</c.simplifiedchinese>

321
00:20:29.728 --> 00:20:34.149 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么御庭番众
什么传说中的刽子手！</c.simplifiedchinese>

322
00:20:34.233 --> 00:20:36.193 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我才是真正的最强</c.simplifiedchinese>

323
00:20:36.276 --> 00:20:39.821 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没有比钱更好的东西！</c.simplifiedchinese>

324
00:20:40.405 --> 00:20:42.783 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我现在就证明给你们看</c.simplifiedchinese>

325
00:20:43.450 --> 00:20:44.952 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>去死吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

326
00:20:45.577 --> 00:20:46.578 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那是什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

327
00:20:50.374 --> 00:20:51.458 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>式尉</c.simplifiedchinese>

328
00:20:51.541 --> 00:20:53.418 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
